1
00:00:02,794 --> 00:00:05,004
(Leonard:)Here you go. Pad Thai, no peanuts.

2
00:00:05,171 --> 00:00:06,421
(Howard:)Does it have peanut oil?

3
00:00:06,589 --> 00:00:07,629
(Leonard:)I'm not sure.

4
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:11,759
(Leonard:)Everyone keep an eye on Howard
in case he starts to swell up.

5
00:00:11,928 --> 00:00:15,098
(Sheldon:)Since it's not bee season,
you can have my epinephrine.

6
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,350
(Raj:)- Any chopsticks?
- Don't need chopsticks, this is Thai food.

7
00:00:18,518 --> 00:00:19,848
(Leonard:)Here we go.

8
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,150
(Sheldon:)Thailand has had the fork
since the latter half of the 19th century.

9
00:00:23,314 --> 00:00:27,064
They don't put the fork in their mouth,
they use it to put the food on a spoon...

10
00:00:27,235 --> 00:00:29,445
(Sheldon:)...which then goes into their mouth.

11
00:00:29,612 --> 00:00:32,112
(Leonard:)Ask him for a napkin, I dare you.

12
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:33,452
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

13
00:00:33,616 --> 00:00:34,946
(Leonard:)I'll get it.

14
00:00:35,118 --> 00:00:37,788
(Howard:)Do I look puffy? I feel puffy.

15
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:40,247
- Hey, Leonard.
- Oh, hi, Penny.

16
00:00:40,415 --> 00:00:41,455
- Am I interrupting?
- No.

17
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:43,084
SHELDON:
You're not swelling, Howard.

18
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:45,591
HOWARD: No, look at my fingers,
they're like Vienna sausages.

19
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:49,504
- Sounds like you have company.
- They're not going anywhere.

20
00:00:50,341 --> 00:00:53,131
(Leonard:)So you're coming home from work.
That's great. How was work?

21
00:00:53,303 --> 00:00:55,053
You know, it's a Cheesecake Factory...

22
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:57,561
(Penny:)...people order cheesecake
and I bring it to them.

23
00:00:57,724 --> 00:01:03,024
So you kind of act
as like a carbohydrate delivery system?

